=== layout: one-panel

# Key ideas to keep

@body

- H~0~ supplies expected counts; keep them unrounded.
- &chi;^2^ = &Sigma; (O-E)^2^ / E
- df = categories - 1 when no parameters are fitted
- Small p supports rejection; large p does not prove H~0~.

